: schema-derived from the OpenRouter usage-accounting reference at openrouter.ai
: provider openrouter, ego 0.1.0
: usage.cost arrives unasked. OpenRouter documents that `usage: {include: true}`
: and `stream_options: {include_usage: true}` are deprecated and have no effect,
: and that full usage is now always included — which is why the family's request
: projection, which sends the second and not the first, is compatible with it.
: The `: OPENROUTER PROCESSING` comment is the keep-alive it emits while a
: provider is being selected; it is here because a decoder that choked on a
: bare SSE comment would fail against every real OpenRouter stream.
: OPENROUTER PROCESSING

